# 📐 Diagram Craft: Publication-Grade Visual Specs

Whenever illustrating architecture, workflows, state transitions, or microservice networks:

## Rules
1. Use crisp, high-contrast ASCII art or Mermaid syntax.
2. Label all protocol boundaries (gRPC, SSE, REST, WebSockets).
3. Explicitly identify failure fallbacks, circuit breakers, and database replicas.

